            source:"src/text_compute.sapp",description:spec.detail+" Inline caller data only: 16384 UTF-8 input bytes, 2048 logical lines, max_chars 1..8192 (default 4000). Result capped at 65536 serialized UTF-8 bytes. Unicode scalar budgets; lossy transformations can remove content. Strings/arrays return under value; maps retain their fields. No files, network, model, execution or trust grant. Returned content may be private; safe_to_log:false.",
